{"strings": {"Assets/Content/Notes/Pharmacy/Suspicious customers.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets14.assets"]}, "Suspicious customers": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets14.assets"]}, "Someone wearing a duck mask\n-Bought the usual stuff. Weird mask. Gave us a duck which we put on the shelf\n\nBleeding woman\n-I called an ambulance! She said she just needs bandages\n\nLilly Cooper\n-My former classmate! Asked some weird questions from Patrik\n\nMumbling woman\n-Gave us a recipe for apple pie!?\n\nWeird guy who smelled like an old sock that has been swimming in a bucket of dead fish\n-Bought over 30 packages of condoms!\n\nPriest\n-He bought painkillers and other medicines that help with fungal disease\n\nTall man\n-Stood quietly and watched the surveillance camera for 10 minutes\n\nWeirdo\n-Asked for a phone number": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets14.assets"]}, "Rain Any": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets14.assets"]}, "Rain Heavy": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets14.assets"]}}}